    Both a sine and a cosine term are included for each i=1, ..., order
    .. math::
       f_{i,s,t} & = \sin\left(2 \pi i \times \frac{t}{m} \right)  \\
       f_{i,c,t} & = \cos\left(2 \pi i \times \frac{t}{m} \right)
